# SAM4E8E boot/connect smoke test. The local sam4e8e.repl is the
# only path - Renode upstream has no SAM4E platform, and using
# upstream sam4s.repl as a base would have caused address conflicts
# (SAM4E PIOD at 0x400E1400 vs SAM4S RSTC, SAM4E WDT at 0x400E1850
# vs nothing on SAM4S, SAM4E AFEC0/AFEC1 vs SAM4S_ADC at a different
# base). printers.test reaches sam4e8e via duet2 boards at config-
# parse depth; this is the end-to-end firmware-boot regression
# target for the chip's standalone repl + AFEC stub injection path.
DICTIONARY sam4e8e.dict
CONFIG sam4e_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR sam4e_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
